.TH SYSSCOPE-GUI 1 "2026-11-15" "sysscope 0.0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sysscope-gui \- desktop client for the SysScope process monitor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sysscope-gui
[\fB\-\-replay\fR \fIFILE.frames.jsonl\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The SysScope desktop app: the live process table and tree, per-process files,
network, syscalls, children and memory maps, findings with their evidence,
follow mode, and the Glasshouse sandbox page. It talks to
.BR sysscoped (8)
over its socket and needs membership in the \fBsysscope\fR group. It refuses
to run as root.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-replay " FILE"
Show a saved recording (made with \fBsysscope replay \-\-frames\fR) instead of
the live daemon.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sysscope (1),
.BR sysscoped (8)
